# Files to exclude from the published package.
#
# IMPORTANT: when a `.pubignore` exists, pub uses it *instead of* `.gitignore`
# for this directory. Any path that must stay out of the archive has to be
# repeated here, even if `.gitignore` already covers it for version control.

# ── Native runtime (proprietary, CLI-provisioned) ──────────────────────
#
# The runtime is downloaded per-project by `synheart install runtime` and is not
# part of this package. `ios/SynheartCoreRuntime.xcframework` is a symlink the
# podspec's prepare_command creates into the consumer app, and pub follows
# symlinks — so these rules are what keep several hundred MB of native binaries
# out of the archive.
*.xcframework/
**/*.xcframework/
ios/SynheartCoreRuntime.xcframework
synheart/vendor/
example/synheart/
**/synheart/vendor/
*.dSYM/
**/*.dSYM/
synheart.lock

# ── Host-app scaffolding that does not belong in a plugin package ──────
ios/Runner/

# Development files
.claude/
# Review/working notes must never reach the published package.
PR_*.md
*_REQUIRED_FIXES.md
__dev__/
.env*
!.env.example
TASKS.md
DEVELOPMENT.md

# IDE files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.iml

# Git files
.git/
.gitignore

# CI/CD (included via .github)
# .github/

# Documentation (keep main docs, exclude drafts)
doc/arch.md

# Build artifacts
build/
.dart_tool/
**/build/
**/.dart_tool/
.gradle/
**/.gradle/

# Test files (if you want to exclude them)
# test/

# Example apps (keep them for pub.dev)
# example/

# Temporary files
*.log
*.tmp
.DS_Store
